    ∃ M₁ : IntermediateField ℚ ℂ, FiniteDimensional ℚ M₁ ∧ ∀ t, ∀ γ ∈ GQ WW, ∀ r ∈ GinfC WW, γ * r ∈ GfC WW → ∀ x k,
